citation:
The information we collect automatically may include Personal Information, or and we may maintain it or associate it with Personal Information we collect in other ways or receive from third parties. It Such collection and association helps us to improve our Website, Apps and the Services offered and to deliver a better and more personalized service, including by enabling us to:

Estimate our audience size and usage patterns.
Store information about your preferences, allowing us to customize our Website, and Apps and Service according to your individual interests.
Speed up your searches.
Recognize you when you return to our Website.
Identify you and ensure the security of our Website, the Apps and the Services and the transmission and storage of data between you and us.
Control unauthorized use or abuse of our Website, the Apps and our Services.

[...]

We use the information that we collect about you or that you provide to us, including any Personal Information:

To present our Website and its contents to you;
To provide the Apps and their contents to you;
To personalize and improve your experience with the Website and the Apps;
To provide you with information, products, or services that you request from us;
To fulfill any other purpose for which you provide it;
To provide you with notices about your account;
To carry out our obligations and enforce our rights arising from any contracts entered into between you and us;
To notify you about changes to our Website or Apps and any products or services we offer or provide though them;
To allow you to participate in interactive features on our Website and Apps;
To enable you to communicate with other users;
To contact you and provide you with help if you have a customer service issue;
To identify and protect you and maintain your account;
To notify you of new products or services we think you might be interested in;
In any other way we may describe when you provide the information; and
For any other purpose with your consent.

